{"id":"5506","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5506_main_cirrus-spissatus-cumulonimbigenitus-and-cumulonimbus-capillatus-incus_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>仍为砧形，该<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">积雨云性密卷云</span>是大约45分钟前一个小而孤立的砧状鬃积雨云的余云。在发展的衰退阶段，新的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">砧状鬃积雨云</span>在左侧地平线约60公里外。在该单体的侧面是<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">浓积云</span>单体或<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">积雨云</span>单体；由于单体距离远且相对较小，无法根据本图做出准确识别。<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">中展</span>云种为主的积云可完成云观测。右侧缩放的单体图像参见附图。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Jarmo Koistinen","location":"芬兰，赫尔辛基","latitude":"纬度: 60° 0' 0'' N","longitude":"经度: 25° 0' 0'' E","date":"08 July 2011 1449 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向北","cloudCode":"CL= 9, CM= 0, CH= 3","code":"图像P/S代码: P.1.5","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.1.5"},{"src":"/images/compressed/5505_main_cirrus-spissatus-cumulonimbogentitus-and-cumulus-mediocris_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>仍为砧状，该<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">积雨云性密卷云</span>是大约45分钟前一个小而孤立的砧状鬃积雨云的余云。</p>\n<p>积云，主要为<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">中展</span>云种，可完成云观测。</p>\n<p>这是放大的图像。详见附图。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Jarmo Koistinen","location":"芬兰，赫尔辛基","latitude":"纬度: 60° 0' 0'' N","longitude":"经度: 25° 0' 0'' E","date":"08 July 2011 1450 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向北","cloudCode":"CL= 2, CM= 0, CH= 3","code":"图像P/S代码: P.1.5","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.1.5"},{"src":"/images/original/syn/5506_syn_cirrus-spissatus-cumulonimbigenitus-and-cumulonimbus-capillatus-incus_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>云图拍摄于中纬度（副热带）暖气团的弱高压脊区。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 德国气象局","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/original/upper/5506_upper_cirrus-spissatus-cumulonimbigenitus-and-cumulonimbus-capillatus-incus_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc4\"><p>探测与云图拍摄是在同一时间，地点是在照片拍摄位置西北100公里。探测确定了相对于该地点的暖气团（850 hPa，12 °C）以及显著的不稳定性（1043 J/kg CAPE），并表明砧状云和卷云的顶部到达12000米的对流层顶高度。估计卷云底的高度为10000米。尽管有大量有效对流能量，但在当天仅有一些分散的小雷暴发展。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 怀俄明大学","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/compressed/sat/5506_sat_cirrus-spissatus-cumulonimbigenitus-and-cumulonimbus-capillatus-incus_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc5\"><p>NOAA-18图像是1、2和4信道的综合，是在云图照片拍摄后半小时的观测图，图中显示出云照片拍摄地附近的晴空区，以及大量浅黄色非降水性积云以及再往北面的一些蓝白色砧状积雨云。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 芬兰气象局","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]},{"type":"seci","label":"其他图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4850_main_cirrus-spissatus-cumulonimbogenitus_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc6\"><p>一股南风气流为香港（中国）附近的广东沿岸带来炎热多雨的天气。密集的云是<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">密</span>卷云，是积雨云的残余部分 - 这可进一步将其定义为人为积雨云性。在地平线上可以看到<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">秃积雨云</span>。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Moon Tong Tsang","location":"中国香港赤鱲角","latitude":"纬度: 22° 18' 56'' N","longitude":"经度: 113° 55' 21'' E","date":"14 June 2015 0536 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向北","cloudCode":"CL= 3, CM= 3, CH= 3","code":"图像P/S代码: S.1.5","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.1.5"},{"src":"/images/compressed/5520_main_cirrus-spisatus-cumulonimbogenitus-cumulus-congestus-and-haze_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc7\"><p>图片上方的云是<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">积雨云性密卷云</span>。它是3小时前在中国香港以南及西南方向100公里发展的一系列雷暴的余云。在这浓密的卷云块之下是另一个典型的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">积雨云性密卷云</span>。在更靠近香港的第二行形成了这一稠密云块的母积雨云。在第二行云的东侧还可看到正在发展的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">浓积云</span>。这些云处于落日的阴影中（照片拍摄于日落前36分钟）。更靠近香港的是第三行云，其构成是东侧的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">中展积云</span>和中间不断增大的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">浓积云</span>。</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">霾</span>已被输送并滞留在近海。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Tak Leung Ng","location":"中国，香港，赤鱲角","latitude":"纬度: 22° 18' 30'' N","longitude":"经度: 113° 55' 5'' E","date":"06 August 2013 1824 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西南","cloudCode":"CL= 2, CM= 0, CH= 3","code":"图像P/S代码: S.1.5 2","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.1.5 2"}]},{"type":"pri","label":"1987年版图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4513_main_cirrus-spissatus-cumulonimbogenitus-with-cumulus-congestus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc8\"><p>（注：时间基于估算）</p>\n<p>一团正在消散的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">积雨云</span>留下了一小片卷云，并在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">2时</span>显示出一些残余降水。其他<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">积云</span>和浓积云正沿着横跨德克萨斯州狭长地带的一条南北向陡崖形成。该区域当时处于干线前方的东南向低层气流中。当天晚些时候，在这附近，一股更强的积雨云在向东移动的干线前方发展起来。</p></div>","copyright":"© C.A. Doswell","location":"Palo Duro Canyon, Texas, United States of America","latitude":"纬度: 34° 55' 48'' N","longitude":"经度: 101° 39' 0'' W","date":"28 June 1975 1700 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西南","cloudCode":"CL= 2, CM= 0, CH= 3","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/compressed/4508_main_formation-and-dissipation-of-cirrus-spissatus-cumulonimbogenitus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc9\"><p>PRE.101、PRE.100、PRE.103、PRE.102中的四幅照片展示了在强劲东风低层气流作用下，奥基乔比湖东岸由数个积雨云形成的密卷云过程。当上升气流从受热的陆地移向较冷的湖面时逐渐减弱，云体上层部分持续存在直至仅剩卷云残留。</p>\n<p>在这张拍摄于五分钟后（PRE.101之后）的图像中，云体已继续成熟并消散。<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">左侧</span>积雨云顶部呈现更明显的纤维状结构，而<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">右侧</span>较小的浓积云已开始消散。</p></div>","copyright":"© R.L. Holle","location":"Pahokee, Florida, United States of America","latitude":"纬度: 26° 49' 12'' N","longitude":"经度: 80° 39' 55'' W","date":"15 August 1973 1057 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西西北","cloudCode":"CL= 9, CM= 0, CH= 3","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/compressed/4511_main_formation-and-dissipation-of-cirrus-spissatus-cumulonimbogenitus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc10\"><p>PRE.101、PRE.100、PRE.103、PRE.102中的四张照片展示了在东风低层气流下，奥基乔比湖东岸多个积雨云形成浓密卷云的过程。当上升气流从受热的陆地移向较冷的水面时，其强度减弱，上层云体持续存在，最终仅剩卷云残留。</p>\n<p>这张照片拍摄于五分钟之后，即第一张照片（PRE.101）拍摄后的16分钟。<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">左侧</span>的积雨云现已呈现与第一张照片中<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">位置5</span>处较早卷云相似的外观。一个新的浓积云塔正开始在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">位置6</span>生长，但它也会像这组照片序列中附近的云一样迅速消散。</p></div>","copyright":"© R.L. Holle","location":"Pahokee, Florida, United States of America","latitude":"纬度: 26° 49' 12'' N","longitude":"经度: 80° 39' 55'' W","date":"15 August 1973 1108 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西西北","cloudCode":"CL= 9, CM= 0, CH= 3","code":"","imageId":""}]}]}